   Leduc, Florence; Morin-Bernard, Alexandre; Moreau, Guillaume; Achim, Alexis, Univ Laval, Dept Sci Bois \& Foret, 2425 Rue Terrasse, Quebec City, PQ G1V 0A6, Canada.
