   Chadwick, Andrew J.; Coops, Nicholas C.; Johnson, Kirk M.; Roeser, Dominik, Univ British Columbia, Fac Forestry, Dept Forest Resources Management, 2424 Main Mall, Vancouver, BC V6T 1Z4, Canada.
