   Trotto, Tommaso; Coops, Nicholas C.; Roeser, Dominik, Univ British Columbia, Dept Forest Resources Management, 2424 Main Mall, Vancouver, BC V6T 1Z4, Canada.
   Achim, Alexis, Univ Laval, Ctr Rech Mat Renouvelables, Dept Sci Bois \& Foret, 2425 Rue Terrasse, Quebec City, PQ G1V 0A6, Canada.
