   Alliance {[}556296-2020]; BC Ministry of Forests; BC Ministry of Water,
   Land and Resource Stewardship; Martin Conservation Decisions Lab;
   University of British Columbia (UBC); Canadian Marbled Murrelet Recovery
   Team},
Funding-Text = {This research was conducted at the Vancouver campus of UBC, which is
   located on the traditional, ancestral, and unceded territory of the x y
   m y theta k yy y yy m (Musqueam) people. This project was funded through
