   Smith-Tripp, SM (Corresponding Author), Univ British Columbia, Dept Forest Resources Management, Vancouver, BC, Canada.
   Smith-Tripp, Sarah M.; Schwartz, Naomi B., Univ British Columbia, Dept Geog, Vancouver, BC, Canada.
   Smith-Tripp, Sarah M.; Eskelson, Bianca N. I.; Coops, Nicholas C., Univ British Columbia, Dept Forest Resources Management, Vancouver, BC, Canada.},
